@startuml CU-10
actor "Administrador / Gestor de catálogo" as Adm
boundary "«UI» Angular (admin)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /suppliers" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» SupplierService / Supplier" as Model

Adm -> UI : Abre gestión de proveedores
UI -> Ctrl : GET /suppliers
Ctrl -> Model : list_suppliers(db)
Model --> Ctrl : list[SupplierRead]
Ctrl --> UI : list[SupplierRead]
UI --> Adm : Proveedores existentes

Adm -> UI : Registra un nuevo proveedor
UI -> Ctrl : POST /suppliers {razón social, RUC/NIT, contacto}
Ctrl -> Model : create_supplier(db, data)
Model --> Ctrl : SupplierRead
Ctrl --> UI : SupplierRead
UI --> Adm : Proveedor registrado

Adm -> UI : Actualiza datos del proveedor
UI -> Ctrl : PATCH /suppliers/{id}
Ctrl -> Model : update_supplier(db, id, data)
Model --> Ctrl : SupplierRead
Ctrl --> UI : SupplierRead
UI --> Adm : Proveedor actualizado

@enduml